msgid "Deny access"
msgstr "禁止访问"

msgid "Read-only"
msgstr "只读"

msgid "Read-write"
msgstr "读写"

msgid "Full control (including delete)"
msgstr "完全控制 (含删除)"

msgid "Accounts and permissions"
msgstr "账户与权限"

msgid "Each account corresponds to one [account-name] section in the chfs configuration file. guest is the visitor account used for anonymous access and cannot be removed. Permission rules apply per directory; separate multiple directories with a vertical bar |."
msgstr "每个账户对应 chfs 配置文件中的一个 [账户名] 段。guest 为访客账户, 用于匿名访问, 不可删除。权限规则按目录生效, 多个目录用竖线 | 分隔。"

msgid "Account list"
msgstr "账户列表"

msgid "The default permission applies to all directories. Per-directory rules may be set to override it."
msgstr "默认权限作用于所有目录, 可再针对特定子目录单独设定权限以覆盖默认值。"

msgid "Account name"
msgstr "账户名"

msgid "Account name must not be empty"
msgstr "账户名不能为空"

msgid "Account name must not contain spaces, brackets or similar characters"
msgstr "账户名不能包含空格、方括号等字符"

msgid "Account name already exists"
msgstr "账户名已存在"

msgid "Password"
msgstr "密码"

msgid "Leave empty for no password"
msgstr "留空表示无密码"

msgid "Default permission"
msgstr "默认权限"

msgid "Denied directories"
msgstr "禁止访问目录"

msgid "Read-only directories"
msgstr "只读目录"

msgid "Read-write directories"
msgstr "读写目录"

msgid "Full control directories"
msgstr "完全控制目录"

msgid "guest is the visitor account used for anonymous access and cannot be removed."
msgstr "guest 为访客账户, 用于匿名访问, 不可删除。"

msgid "chfs binary not installed"
msgstr "未安装 chfs 程序"

msgid "Running"
msgstr "运行中"

msgid "Enabled but not running"
msgstr "已启用但未运行"

msgid "Stopped"
msgstr "已停止"

msgid "chfs File Sharing"
msgstr "chfs 文件共享"

msgid "CuteHttpFileServer is an HTTP-based file sharing server. Use this page to configure the service; changes take effect after a restart."
msgstr "CuteHttpFileServer 是一个基于 HTTP 协议的文件共享服务器。本页面用于配置服务参数, 保存后需重启服务方可生效。"

msgid "Running status"
msgstr "运行状态"

msgid "PID"
msgstr "进程号"

msgid "Memory usage"
msgstr "内存占用"

msgid "Port"
msgstr "端口"

msgid "The port setting has changed but the service has not been restarted; the old configuration is still active. Restart the service to apply it."
msgstr "端口配置已修改但服务尚未重启, 当前运行的是旧配置, 请点击重启服务使其生效。"

msgid "Service control"
msgstr "服务控制"

msgid "Service action"
msgstr "服务操作"

msgid "Success"
msgstr "成功"

msgid "Start"
msgstr "启动"

msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

msgid "Restart"
msgstr "重启"

msgid "Note: the service is currently disabled. Save the configuration and tick \"Enable service\" first."
msgstr "提示: 服务当前处于未启用状态, 请先保存配置并勾选\"启用服务\"。"

msgid "Enable service"
msgstr "启用服务"

msgid "When disabled the service will not start at boot and cannot be started from this page."
msgstr "关闭后服务不会随系统启动, 且无法在界面中启动。"

msgid "Listening port"
msgstr "监听端口"

msgid "HTTP listening port, range 1-65535. Ports below 1024 require root privileges."
msgstr "HTTP 服务监听端口, 取值 1-65535。小于 1024 的端口需要 root 身份运行。"

msgid "Port must be an integer between 1 and 65535"
msgstr "端口必须是 1-65535 之间的整数"

msgid "Shared root directory"
msgstr "共享根目录"

msgid "Directories to share. Separate multiple directories with a vertical bar |, e.g. /mnt/sda1|/tmp/share. Leaving this empty prevents the service from starting."
msgstr "需要共享的目录。多个目录之间用竖线 | 分隔, 例如 /mnt/sda1|/tmp/share。留空将导致服务无法启动。"

msgid "Shared root directory must not be empty"
msgstr "共享根目录不能为空"

msgid "Run as user"
msgstr "运行身份"

msgid "Running as a non-root user is recommended to reduce risk. Ensure that user has proper read/write permissions on the shared directories."
msgstr "建议使用非 root 身份运行以降低风险。需确保该用户对共享目录有相应读写权限。"

msgid "root (full privileges)"
msgstr "root (最高权限)"

msgid "nobody (restricted privileges)"
msgstr "nobody (受限权限)"

msgid "Allow anonymous access"
msgstr "允许匿名访问"

msgid "When enabled, unauthenticated users access as the guest account with the rules configured for guest."
msgstr "启用后未登录用户以 guest 账户身份访问, 权限由账户列表中 guest 的规则决定。"

msgid "IP allowlist"
msgstr "IP 白名单"

msgid "Only allow access from the listed addresses. Leave empty for no restriction. Single addresses such as 192.168.1.10 and subnets such as 192.168.1.0/24 are supported; separate multiple entries with a vertical bar |."
msgstr "仅允许列表中的地址访问, 留空表示不限制。支持单个地址 192.168.1.10 与网段 192.168.1.0/24, 多条用竖线 | 分隔。"

msgid "Invalid IP rule format"
msgstr "IP 规则格式非法"

msgid "Directory download policy"
msgstr "目录下载策略"

msgid "Controls whether whole directories may be downloaded as archives."
msgstr "控制是否允许将整个目录打包下载。"

msgid "Allow (unrestricted)"
msgstr "允许 (不限制)"

msgid "Leaf directories only"
msgstr "仅限叶子目录 (不含子目录时)"

msgid "Disable directory download"
msgstr "禁用目录下载"

msgid "File removal method"
msgstr "文件删除方式"

msgid "Strategy applied when deleting files."
msgstr "删除文件时采用的处理策略。"

msgid "Move to system trash"
msgstr "移入系统回收站"

msgid "Move to chfs trash bin (~/.chfs_trashbin)"
msgstr "移入 chfs 专属回收站 (~/.chfs_trashbin)"

msgid "Delete permanently"
msgstr "直接永久删除"

msgid "Session timeout"
msgstr "会话超时"

msgid "Validity period of a login session in minutes, range 1-1440."
msgstr "登录会话的有效期, 单位分钟, 取值 1-1440。"

msgid "Enable image thumbnails"
msgstr "启用图片缩略图"

msgid "Show thumbnails for image files in the web UI. Enabling this increases server-side computation overhead."
msgstr "在网页中显示图片文件的缩略图。开启后会增加服务端计算开销。"

msgid "Operation log directory"
msgstr "操作日志目录"

msgid "Directory for user operation logs. Leave empty to disable logging."
msgstr "记录用户操作日志的目录, 留空表示禁用日志。"

msgid "Output to syslog"
msgstr "输出到系统日志"

msgid "Redirect service stdout to syslog, viewable via logread."
msgstr "将服务标准输出接入系统日志, 可通过 logread 查看。"

msgid "Page title"
msgstr "页面标题"

msgid "Page notice"
msgstr "页面公告"

msgid "Notice shown at the top of the page. Plain text, or an HTML fragment wrapped in backticks."
msgstr "显示在页面顶部的公告内容。可填写纯文本, 或用反引号包裹 HTML 片段。"

msgid "HTTPS certificate path"
msgstr "HTTPS 证书路径"

msgid "Path to the certificate file. Both certificate and private key must be set to enable HTTPS; the listening port is normally 443 then."
msgstr "证书文件路径。证书与私钥必须同时填写才启用 HTTPS, 此时监听端口通常应设为 443。"

msgid "HTTPS private key path"
msgstr "HTTPS 私钥路径"

msgid "Path to the private key file. Must be used together with the certificate."
msgstr "私钥文件路径。需与证书文件配套。"

msgid "Configuration saved, service restarted"
msgstr "配置已保存, 服务已重启"

msgid "Configuration saved. Changes take effect after restarting the service."
msgstr "配置已保存。修改需重启服务后生效。"

msgid "Please wait"
msgstr "请稍候"

msgid "Executing %s ..."
msgstr "正在执行 %s ..."

msgid "Operation succeeded"
msgstr "操作成功"

msgid "Operation failed"
msgstr "操作失败"

msgid "Unknown error"
msgstr "未知错误"

msgid "Request failed"
msgstr "请求失败"

msgid "chfs Service Status"
msgstr "chfs 服务状态"

msgid "Data on this page is obtained by live probing and reflects the real running state of the service."
msgstr "本页数据通过实际探测获取, 反映服务真实运行状态。"

msgid "Process information"
msgstr "进程信息"

msgid "Start on boot"
msgstr "开机自启"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "已启用"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "未启用"

msgid "Program file"
msgstr "程序文件"

msgid "Present"
msgstr "存在"

msgid "Missing (/usr/bin/chfs)"
msgstr "缺失 (/usr/bin/chfs)"

msgid "Configuration file"
msgstr "配置文件"

msgid "Generated (/var/etc/chfs.ini)"
msgstr "已生成 (/var/etc/chfs.ini)"

msgid "Not generated"
msgstr "未生成"

msgid "The configured port differs from the running instance. Please restart the service."
msgstr "配置中的端口与运行中实例不一致, 请重启服务。"

msgid "Listening"
msgstr "监听中"

msgid "Not listening"
msgstr "未监听"

msgid "Port listening"
msgstr "端口监听"

msgid "Configured port"
msgstr "配置端口"

msgid "Listen status"
msgstr "监听状态"

msgid "Available"
msgstr "可用"

msgid "Service is not running, cannot probe"
msgstr "服务未运行, 无法探测"

msgid "Unavailable"
msgstr "不可用"

msgid "WebDAV access"
msgstr "WebDAV 访问"

msgid "Probe result"
msgstr "探测结果"

msgid "HTTP status code"
msgstr "HTTP 状态码"

msgid "Access protocol"
msgstr "访问协议"

msgid "Access address"
msgstr "访问地址"

msgid "Since version 1.10 chfs supports WebDAV by default. It shares the same port, the same account rules and the same IP allowlist as HTTP, with no extra switch. Replace <host> in the address with the actual IP or domain of the router."
msgstr "chfs 自 1.10 版本起默认支持 WebDAV, 与 HTTP 共用同一端口、同一套账户权限与 IP 白名单规则, 无需额外开启。地址中的 <主机地址> 请替换为路由器的实际 IP 或域名。"

msgid "Address copied"
msgstr "地址已复制"

msgid "Please copy manually"
msgstr "请手动复制"

msgid "Copy WebDAV address"
msgstr "复制 WebDAV 地址"

msgid "Generated configuration file"
msgstr "生成的配置文件"

msgid "The following is the actual chfs.ini read by the service (located at /var/etc/chfs.ini), rendered automatically from the UCI configuration."
msgstr "以下为服务实际读取的 chfs.ini 内容 (位于 /var/etc/chfs.ini), 由 UCI 配置自动渲染生成。"

msgid "The configuration file has not been generated yet. Start the service once first."
msgstr "配置文件尚未生成, 请先启动一次服务。"

msgid "Refresh status"
msgstr "刷新状态"

msgid "NAS"
msgstr "网络存储"

msgid "Service Status"
msgstr "服务状态"

msgid "Service settings"
msgstr "服务设置"

msgid "bytes"
msgstr "字节"

msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "未知"

msgid "Matches"
msgstr "匹配"

msgid "Mismatch"
msgstr "不匹配"

msgid "chfs kernel management"
msgstr "chfs 内核管理"

msgid "Replace the chfs binary used by the service. Kernels can be downloaded from this project repository or uploaded manually; either way the file is placed in a pending area first and only written to the program path after you confirm, so a wrong or unreadable binary never silently replaces a working one."
msgstr "替换服务使用的 chfs 可执行文件。内核既可从本仓库下载, 也可手动上传; 两种方式都会先保存到待安装区, 只有在你确认之后才会写入程序路径, 因此出错或无法运行的文件不会悄悄覆盖当前可用的内核。"

msgid "Current kernel"
msgstr "当前内核"

msgid "The chfs binary was not found. Install the chfs package or use one of the options below."
msgstr "未找到 chfs 可执行文件。请安装 chfs 包, 或使用下方的任一方式获取。"

msgid "Device architecture"
msgstr "设备架构"

msgid "Kernel branch"
msgstr "内核分支"

msgid "Program path"
msgstr "程序路径"

msgid "File size"
msgstr "文件大小"

msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架构"

msgid "SHA256"
msgstr "SHA256"

msgid "Expected version"
msgstr "预期版本"

msgid "Click \"Detect sources\" to check which download sources are reachable from this device. Detection issues a HEAD request to each candidate and does not download any payload."
msgstr "点击「检测下载源」可检查本设备能访问哪些下载源。检测只对每个候选源发起 HEAD 请求, 不会下载任何内容。"

msgid "Detect sources"
msgstr "检测下载源"

msgid "One-click download"
msgstr "一键下载"

msgid "Download a kernel built for this device from this project repository. The file is saved to the pending area and is not installed automatically."
msgstr "从本仓库下载适配本设备的内核。文件会保存到待安装区, 不会自动安装。"

msgid "No file selected"
msgstr "未选择文件"

msgid "Please choose a file first"
msgstr "请先选择文件"

msgid "Upload"
msgstr "上传"

msgid "Manual upload"
msgstr "手动上传"

msgid "Upload a chfs binary from your computer. This is the fallback when the device cannot reach any download source. The file is saved to the pending area and must be installed afterwards."
msgstr "从本机上传 chfs 可执行文件。当设备无法访问任何下载源时可用此方式兜底。文件会保存到待安装区, 之后需手动安装。"

msgid "Pending files"
msgstr "待安装文件"

msgid "Files in the pending area. Installing one will stop the service, replace the program file and start it again."
msgstr "待安装区中的文件。安装某个文件会停止服务、替换程序文件, 然后重新启动服务。"

msgid "No pending files."
msgstr "暂无待安装文件。"

msgid "Install this kernel?"
msgstr "安装该内核?"

msgid "The service will be stopped, %s will be replaced and the service will be started again. The current kernel is backed up first."
msgstr "服务将被停止, %s 将被替换, 随后服务会重新启动。当前内核会先被备份。"

msgid "Install"
msgstr "安装"

msgid "Installing kernel ..."
msgstr "正在安装内核 ..."

msgid "Kernel installed"
msgstr "内核已安装"

msgid "Delete this file?"
msgstr "删除该文件?"

msgid "The file will be removed from the pending area. This does not affect the running kernel."
msgstr "文件将从待安装区移除, 不影响正在运行的内核。"

msgid "Delete"
msgstr "删除"

msgid "Deleting file ..."
msgstr "正在删除文件 ..."

msgid "File deleted"
msgstr "文件已删除"

msgid "Not an ELF file"
msgstr "非 ELF 文件"

msgid "File name"
msgstr "文件名"

msgid "Size"
msgstr "大小"

msgid "ELF architecture"
msgstr "ELF 架构"

msgid "Actions"
msgstr "操作"

msgid "Backups"
msgstr "备份"

msgid "A backup of the program file is created automatically before every install. Rolling back replaces the running binary with the selected backup."
msgstr "每次安装前会自动备份程序文件。回滚会用选定的备份替换正在运行的可执行文件。"

msgid "No backups available."
msgstr "暂无可用备份。"

msgid "Roll back to this backup?"
msgstr "回滚到该备份?"

msgid "The running kernel will be replaced by this backup and the service will be restarted. The backup file itself is kept."
msgstr "正在运行的内核将被该备份替换, 服务会重新启动。备份文件本身会保留。"

msgid "Roll back"
msgstr "回滚"

msgid "Rolling back ..."
msgstr "正在回滚 ..."

msgid "Rolled back"
msgstr "已回滚"

msgid "Backup file"
msgstr "备份文件"

msgid "Safety notes"
msgstr "安全提示"

msgid "The kernel runs as root. Only install binaries from sources you trust; a binary that fails to start will leave the service down until it is rolled back."
msgstr "内核以 root 身份运行。请只安装来自可信来源的可执行文件; 无法启动的文件会导致服务中断, 需回滚后才能恢复。"

msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "刷新"

msgid "Detecting download sources, please wait ..."
msgstr "正在检测下载源, 请稍候 ..."

msgid "Detection failed"
msgstr "检测失败"

msgid "Download this kernel?"
msgstr "下载该内核?"

msgid "The file will be downloaded to the pending area. The running kernel is not touched until you click Install."
msgstr "文件将下载到待安装区。在点击「安装」之前, 不会改动正在运行的内核。"

msgid "Download"
msgstr "下载"

msgid "Downloading kernel, this may take a while ..."
msgstr "正在下载内核, 可能需要一段时间 ..."

msgid "Download finished"
msgstr "下载完成"

msgid "Transport used"
msgstr "使用的传输工具"

msgid "Download source"
msgstr "下载源"

msgid "URL"
msgstr "地址"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "HTTP code"
msgstr "HTTP 状态码"

msgid "Network error"
msgstr "网络错误"

msgid "Upload finished"
msgstr "上传完成"

msgid "Review the pending list below and click Install to apply it."
msgstr "请在下方待安装列表中核对, 然后点击「安装」应用。"

msgid "Upload failed"
msgstr "上传失败"

msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "确定"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "Kernel management"
msgstr "内核管理"

msgid "WebUI access"
msgstr "WebUI 访问"

msgid "Open WebUI"
msgstr "打开 WebUI"

msgid "The service is not running; starting it will make the WebUI reachable at this address."
msgstr "服务未运行; 启动后即可通过该地址访问 WebUI。"
